{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-page","blocks":{"heading":{"type":"text","name":"Title","settings":{"text":"<p>Mit Herz für Haustiere!<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"center","type_preset":"custom","font":"var(--font-heading--family)","font_size":"2rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground-heading)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}},"text_nMqXwC":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.text","settings":{"text":"<p>Wir sind <strong>Julian (22)<\/strong> und <strong>Alex (24)<\/strong>, zwei Tierliebhaber, die PetWorld gegründet haben, um Haustierbesitzern personalisierbare Produkte zu bieten, die sowohl funktional als auch einzigartig sind.<\/p><p> <\/p><p>In der ersten Phase konzentrieren wir uns auf Produkte wie <strong>Puzzle<\/strong>, <strong>Poster<\/strong>, <strong>Kalender<\/strong>, <strong>Kissen<\/strong>, <strong>Hundebetten<\/strong> und <strong>Tassen<\/strong> – alles personalisierbar, damit du etwas ganz Besonderes für dein Haustier kreieren kannst. Unsere Produkte werden von einem erfahrenen Partner produziert, der sich auf hochwertige, personalisierbare Artikel spezialisiert hat.<\/p><p> <\/p><p><strong>Warum PetWorld?<\/strong><\/p><ul><li><strong>Individuell<\/strong>: Gestalte Produkte, die deine Persönlichkeit und die deines Haustiers widerspiegeln.<\/li><li><strong>Qualität<\/strong>: Wir bieten dir nur Produkte, die langlebig und sorgfältig gefertigt sind.<\/li><li><strong>Einfach<\/strong>: Deine Bestellung wird schnell und zuverlässig zu dir nach Hause geliefert.<\/li><\/ul><p><em><strong>PetWorld ist mehr als nur ein Shop – es geht darum, das Leben mit deinem Haustier noch schöner und persönlicher zu gestalten.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"none","alignment":"left","type_preset":"custom","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"0.875rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["heading","text_nMqXwC"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"content_direction":"column","gap":32,"color_scheme":"scheme-7e76d070-642f-4b91-91c1-b5364c47dceb","padding-block-start":48,"padding-block-end":48}},"section_Emr3gQ":{"type":"section","blocks":{"text_UTXWnj":{"type":"text","name":"Title","settings":{"text":"<p>Widerrufsrecht<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"center","type_preset":"custom","font":"var(--font-heading--family)","font_size":"2rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground-heading)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}},"text_DLgzRM":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.text","settings":{"text":"<p>Zuletzt aktualisiert: April 2025<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"none","alignment":"center","type_preset":"custom","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"0.875rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}},"group_tWYTBf":{"type":"group","name":"Verbraucherbegriff","settings":{"content_direction":"column","vertical_on_mobile":true,"horizontal_alignment":"flex-start","vertical_alignment":"center","align_baseline":false,"horizontal_alignment_flex_direction_column":"flex-start","vertical_alignment_flex_direction_column":"center","gap":5,"width":"fill","custom_width":100,"width_mobile":"fill","custom_width_mobile":100,"height":"fit","custom_height":100,"inherit_color_scheme":true,"color_scheme":"","background_media":"none","video_position":"cover","background_image_position":"cover","border":"none","border_width":1,"border_opacity":100,"border_radius":0,"toggle_overlay":false,"overlay_color":"#00000026","overlay_style":"solid","gradient_direction":"to top","link":"","open_in_new_tab":false,"placeholder":"","padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{"text_VNmGtx":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.heading","settings":{"text":"<p>Verbraucherbegriff<\/p>","width":"fit-content","max_width":"narrow","alignment":"center","type_preset":"custom","font":"var(--font-heading--family)","font_size":"1.5rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground-heading)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":30,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}},"text_ik7KTY":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.text","settings":{"text":"<p>Verbraucher ist jede natürliche Person, die ein Rechtsgeschäft zu Zwecken abschließt, die überwiegend <strong>weder<\/strong> ihrer gewerblichen noch ihrer selbstständigen beruflichen Tätigkeit zugerechnet werden können.<\/p>","width":"fit-content","max_width":"none","alignment":"left","type_preset":"custom","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"0.875rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_VNmGtx","text_ik7KTY"]},"group_V8Tq3T":{"type":"group","name":"Widerrufsfrist","settings":{"content_direction":"column","vertical_on_mobile":true,"horizontal_alignment":"flex-start","vertical_alignment":"center","align_baseline":false,"horizontal_alignment_flex_direction_column":"flex-start","vertical_alignment_flex_direction_column":"center","gap":5,"width":"fill","custom_width":100,"width_mobile":"fill","custom_width_mobile":100,"height":"fit","custom_height":100,"inherit_color_scheme":true,"color_scheme":"","background_media":"none","video_position":"cover","background_image_position":"cover","border":"none","border_width":1,"border_opacity":100,"border_radius":0,"toggle_overlay":false,"overlay_color":"#00000026","overlay_style":"solid","gradient_direction":"to top","link":"","open_in_new_tab":false,"placeholder":"","padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{"text_bmHhnt":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.heading","settings":{"text":"<p>Widerrufsfrist<\/p>","width":"fit-content","max_width":"narrow","alignment":"center","type_preset":"custom","font":"var(--font-heading--family)","font_size":"1.5rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground-heading)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":30,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}},"text_eKXPCq":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.text","settings":{"text":"<p>Sie haben das Recht, nicht personalisierte Produkte innerhalb von 14 Tagen ohne Angabe von Gründen zu widerrufen. <\/p><p>Die Widerrufsfrist beträgt 14 Tage ab dem Tag, <\/p><p>1. an dem Sie oder ein von Ihnen benannter Dritter, der nicht der Beförderer ist, die Waren in Besitz genommen haben bzw. hat, sofern Sie <strong>eine oder mehrere<\/strong> Waren im Rahmen <strong>einer einheitlichen Bestellung<\/strong> bestellt haben und diese <strong>einheitlich geliefert<\/strong> wird bzw. werden;<\/p><p>2. an dem Sie oder ein von Ihnen benannter Dritter, der nicht der Beförderer ist, die <strong>letzte Ware<\/strong> in Besitz genommen haben bzw. hat, sofern Sie <strong>mehrere Waren<\/strong> im Rahmen <strong>einer einheitlichen Bestellung<\/strong> bestellt haben und diese <strong>getrennt geliefert<\/strong> werden;<\/p><p>3. an dem Sie oder ein von Ihnen benannter Dritter, der nicht der Beförderer ist, die <strong>letzte Teilsendung<\/strong> oder das <strong>letzte Stück<\/strong> in Besitz genommen haben bzw. hat, sofern Sie eine Ware bestellt haben, die <strong>in mehreren Teilsendungen oder Stücken<\/strong> geliefert wird.<\/p>","width":"fit-content","max_width":"none","alignment":"left","type_preset":"custom","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"0.875rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_bmHhnt","text_eKXPCq"]},"group_mBLLFq":{"type":"group","name":"Ausübung des Widerrufsrechts","settings":{"content_direction":"column","vertical_on_mobile":true,"horizontal_alignment":"flex-start","vertical_alignment":"center","align_baseline":false,"horizontal_alignment_flex_direction_column":"flex-start","vertical_alignment_flex_direction_column":"center","gap":5,"width":"fill","custom_width":100,"width_mobile":"fill","custom_width_mobile":100,"height":"fit","custom_height":100,"inherit_color_scheme":true,"color_scheme":"","background_media":"none","video_position":"cover","background_image_position":"cover","border":"none","border_width":1,"border_opacity":100,"border_radius":0,"toggle_overlay":false,"overlay_color":"#00000026","overlay_style":"solid","gradient_direction":"to top","link":"","open_in_new_tab":false,"placeholder":"","padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{"text_AJ4UEf":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.heading","settings":{"text":"<p>Ausübung des Widerrufsrechts<\/p>","width":"fit-content","max_width":"narrow","alignment":"center","type_preset":"custom","font":"var(--font-heading--family)","font_size":"1.5rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground-heading)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":30,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}},"text_Wqbb9b":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.text","settings":{"text":"<p>Um Ihr Widerrufsrecht auszuüben, müssen Sie uns mittels einer <strong>eindeutigen Erklärung<\/strong> (z. B. ein mit der Post versandter Brief oder E-Mail) über Ihren Entschluss, diesen Vertrag zu widerrufen, informieren. <br\/>Sie können dafür das unten stehende <strong>Muster-Widerrufsformular<\/strong> verwenden, das jedoch nicht vorgeschrieben ist.<\/p><p>Zur Wahrung der Widerrufsfrist reicht es aus, dass Sie die Mitteilung über die Ausübung des Widerrufsrechts <strong>vor Ablauf der Widerrufsfrist<\/strong> absenden.<\/p>","width":"fit-content","max_width":"none","alignment":"left","type_preset":"custom","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"0.875rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_AJ4UEf","text_Wqbb9b"]},"group_WyLCpR":{"type":"group","name":"Folgen des Widerrufs","settings":{"content_direction":"column","vertical_on_mobile":true,"horizontal_alignment":"flex-start","vertical_alignment":"center","align_baseline":false,"horizontal_alignment_flex_direction_column":"flex-start","vertical_alignment_flex_direction_column":"center","gap":5,"width":"fill","custom_width":100,"width_mobile":"fill","custom_width_mobile":100,"height":"fit","custom_height":100,"inherit_color_scheme":true,"color_scheme":"","background_media":"none","video_position":"cover","background_image_position":"cover","border":"none","border_width":1,"border_opacity":100,"border_radius":0,"toggle_overlay":false,"overlay_color":"#00000026","overlay_style":"solid","gradient_direction":"to top","link":"","open_in_new_tab":false,"placeholder":"","padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{"text_KQ4HUy":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.heading","settings":{"text":"<p>Folgen des Widerrufs<\/p>","width":"fit-content","max_width":"none","alignment":"center","type_preset":"custom","font":"var(--font-heading--family)","font_size":"1.5rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground-heading)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":30,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}},"text_MAniCF":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.text","settings":{"text":"<p>Wenn Sie diesen Vertrag widerrufen, haben wir Ihnen <strong>alle Zahlungen<\/strong>, die wir von Ihnen erhalten haben, <strong>einschließlich<\/strong> der Lieferkosten (mit Ausnahme der zusätzlichen Kosten, die sich daraus ergeben, dass Sie <strong>eine andere Art der Lieferung<\/strong> als die von uns angebotene, günstigste Standardlieferung gewählt haben) unverzüglich und spätestens innerhalb von 14 Tagen ab dem Tag zurückzuzahlen, an dem die Mitteilung über Ihren Widerruf bei uns eingegangen ist.<\/p><p>Für diese Rückzahlung verwenden wir <strong>dasselbe Zahlungsmittel<\/strong>, das Sie bei der ursprünglichen Transaktion eingesetzt haben, es sei denn, es wurde mit Ihnen ausdrücklich <strong>etwas anderes<\/strong> vereinbart; in keinem Fall werden Ihnen wegen dieser Rückzahlung Entgelte berechnet.<\/p><p>Wir können die Rückzahlung verweigern, bis wir die Waren wieder zurückerhalten haben oder <strong>bis Sie den Nachweis erbracht<\/strong> haben, dass Sie die Waren zurückgesandt haben, je nachdem, welches der frühere Zeitpunkt ist.<\/p><p>Sie haben die Waren unverzüglich und in jedem Fall spätestens binnen <strong>14 Tagen<\/strong> ab dem Tag, an dem Sie uns über den Widerruf dieses Vertrags unterrichten, an uns zurückzusenden oder zu übergeben. Die Frist ist gewahrt, wenn Sie die Waren vor Ablauf der 14-Tage-Frist absenden.<\/p><p>Sie tragen die <strong>unmittelbaren Kosten<\/strong> der Rücksendung der Waren.<\/p><p>Sie müssen für einen etwaigen Wertverlust der Waren nur aufkommen, wenn dieser Wertverlust auf einen zur Prüfung der <strong>Beschaffenheit, Eigenschaften und Funktionsweise<\/strong> der Waren <strong>nicht notwendigen<\/strong> Umgang mit ihnen zurückzuführen ist.<\/p>","width":"fit-content","max_width":"none","alignment":"left","type_preset":"custom","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"0.875rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_KQ4HUy","text_MAniCF"]},"group_h6QMDt":{"type":"group","name":"Ausschluss- bzw. Erlöschensgründe","settings":{"content_direction":"column","vertical_on_mobile":true,"horizontal_alignment":"flex-start","vertical_alignment":"center","align_baseline":false,"horizontal_alignment_flex_direction_column":"flex-start","vertical_alignment_flex_direction_column":"center","gap":5,"width":"fill","custom_width":100,"width_mobile":"fill","custom_width_mobile":100,"height":"fit","custom_height":100,"inherit_color_scheme":true,"color_scheme":"","background_media":"none","video_position":"cover","background_image_position":"cover","border":"none","border_width":1,"border_opacity":100,"border_radius":0,"toggle_overlay":false,"overlay_color":"#00000026","overlay_style":"solid","gradient_direction":"to top","link":"","open_in_new_tab":false,"placeholder":"","padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{"text_4nYYRp":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.heading","settings":{"text":"<p>Ausschluss- bzw. Erlöschensgründe<\/p>","width":"fit-content","max_width":"none","alignment":"center","type_preset":"custom","font":"var(--font-heading--family)","font_size":"1.5rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground-heading)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":30,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}},"text_8JgfNN":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.text","settings":{"text":"<p>Das Widerrufsrecht besteht <strong>nicht<\/strong> bei Verträgen<\/p><ul><li>zur Lieferung von Waren, die nicht vorgefertigt sind und für deren Herstellung eine <strong>individuelle Auswahl<\/strong> oder Bestimmung durch den Verbraucher maßgeblich ist oder die eindeutig auf die <strong>persönlichen Bedürfnisse<\/strong> des Verbrauchers zugeschnitten sind;<\/li><li>zur Lieferung von Waren, die <strong>schnell verderben<\/strong> können oder deren Verfallsdatum schnell überschritten würde;<\/li><li>zur Lieferung <strong>alkoholischer Getränke<\/strong>, deren Preis bei Vertragsschluss vereinbart wurde, die aber frühestens 30 Tage nach Vertragsschluss geliefert werden können und deren aktueller Wert von <strong>Marktschwankungen<\/strong> abhängt, auf die der Unternehmer keinen Einfluss hat;<\/li><li>zur Lieferung von <strong>Zeitungen, Zeitschriften oder Illustrierten<\/strong> mit Ausnahme von Abonnement-Verträgen.<\/li><\/ul><p>Das Widerrufsrecht <strong>erlischt vorzeitig<\/strong> bei Verträgen<\/p><ul><li>zur Lieferung <strong>versiegelter Waren<\/strong>, die aus Gründen des Gesundheitsschutzes oder der Hygiene <strong>nicht<\/strong> zur Rückgabe geeignet sind, wenn ihre Versiegelung nach der Lieferung entfernt wurde;<\/li><li>zur Lieferung von Waren, wenn diese nach der Lieferung aufgrund ihrer Beschaffenheit <strong>untrennbar<\/strong> mit anderen Gütern vermischt wurden;<\/li><li>zur Lieferung von <strong>Ton- oder Videoaufnahmen<\/strong> oder <strong>Computersoftware<\/strong> in einer versiegelten Packung, wenn die Versiegelung nach der Lieferung entfernt wurde.<\/li><\/ul>","width":"fit-content","max_width":"none","alignment":"left","type_preset":"custom","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"0.875rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_4nYYRp","text_8JgfNN"]},"group_Rbxw8U":{"type":"group","name":"Muster- Widerrufsformular","settings":{"content_direction":"column","vertical_on_mobile":true,"horizontal_alignment":"flex-start","vertical_alignment":"center","align_baseline":false,"horizontal_alignment_flex_direction_column":"flex-start","vertical_alignment_flex_direction_column":"center","gap":5,"width":"fill","custom_width":100,"width_mobile":"fill","custom_width_mobile":100,"height":"fit","custom_height":100,"inherit_color_scheme":true,"color_scheme":"","background_media":"none","video_position":"cover","background_image_position":"cover","border":"none","border_width":1,"border_opacity":100,"border_radius":0,"toggle_overlay":false,"overlay_color":"#00000026","overlay_style":"solid","gradient_direction":"to top","link":"","open_in_new_tab":false,"placeholder":"","padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{"text_JgiDi7":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.heading","settings":{"text":"<p>Muster- Widerrufsformular<\/p>","width":"fit-content","max_width":"none","alignment":"center","type_preset":"custom","font":"var(--font-heading--family)","font_size":"1.5rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground-heading)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":30,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}},"text_QjfrCc":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.text","settings":{"text":"<p><em>Wenn Sie den Vertrag widerrufen wollen, dann füllen Sie bitte dieses Formular aus und senden Sie es an uns zurück.)<\/em><\/p><p><strong>- An<\/strong>: <em>Julian Kases, Absberggasse 7\/26, 1100, Wien, E-Mail-Adresse:<\/em> <a href=\"mailto:xxx@xxx.de\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">support@pet-world.at<\/span><\/a><br\/><\/p><p><strong>- Hiermit widerrufe(n) ich\/ wir (<\/strong><em><strong>) den von mir\/ uns (<\/strong><\/em><strong>) abgeschlossenen Vertrag über den Kauf der folgenden Waren (<\/strong><em><strong>) \/ die Erbringung der folgenden Dienstleistung (<\/strong><\/em><strong>):<\/strong><br\/><br\/>- Bestellt am (*)\/ erhalten am (*) - Name des\/ der Verbraucher(s)<br\/><br\/>- Anschrift des\/ der Verbraucher(s)<br\/><br\/>- Unterschrift des\/ der Verbraucher(s) (nur bei Mitteilung auf Papier) - Datum<br\/><\/p><p>(*) Unzutreffendes streichen.<\/p>","width":"fit-content","max_width":"none","alignment":"left","type_preset":"custom","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"0.875rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_JgiDi7","text_QjfrCc"]}},"block_order":["text_UTXWnj","text_DLgzRM","group_tWYTBf","group_V8Tq3T","group_mBLLFq","group_WyLCpR","group_h6QMDt","group_Rbxw8U"],"name":"t:names.custom_section","settings":{"content_direction":"column","vertical_on_mobile":true,"horizontal_alignment":"flex-start","vertical_alignment":"center","align_baseline":false,"horizontal_alignment_flex_direction_column":"flex-start","vertical_alignment_flex_direction_column":"center","gap":0,"section_width":"page-width","section_height":"small","section_height_custom":50,"color_scheme":"scheme-7e76d070-642f-4b91-91c1-b5364c47dceb","background_media":"none","video_position":"cover","background_image_position":"cover","border":"none","border_width":1,"border_opacity":100,"border_radius":0,"toggle_overlay":false,"overlay_color":"#00000026","overlay_style":"solid","gradient_direction":"to top","padding-block-start":48,"padding-block-end":48}}},"order":["main","section_Emr3gQ"]}